-- 1094: Blog series — 15 WSQ Autodesk course guides, spread uniformly across 2024.
--
-- Covers every LIVE WSQ (TGS-) course in the autodesk-software-courses tree (cat 71)
-- and the autodesk-certification-exams tree (cat 222), deduped. The 8 C-prefix ACP/ACU
-- courses in cat 222 are DISABLED on the storefront and are deliberately NOT covered —
-- linking to a disabled product would ship a dead CTA.
--
-- Notes for future editors:
