but the underlying workflow does not. If your office runs an older version, tell your trainer and they will point out the differences.</p> <h3>Will I be able to use this at work straight away?</h3><p>That is the intent. The exercises are built around realistic tasks rather than toy examples, so the workflow you practise is the one you will repeat on the job.</p> <h2>Next step</h2> <p>If this matches the work you do — or the work you want to move into — <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/wsq-generative-ai-design-for-civil-3d.html">WSQ - Generative AI Design for Civil 3D</a> is the course page, with the current schedule and the funding breakdown. Claim up to 70% WSQ funding or use your SkillsFuture Credit.</p> <p><em>Course fees, funding tiers and software versions change. Figures here were correct at the time of writing — confirm the current position on the course page before enrolling.</em></p>', 'Tertiary Infotech Academy', 1, '2024-09-05', 'TGS-2023039180', 'TGS-2023039180', 'Generative AI Design for Civil 3D: Faster Infrastructure Options (WSQ-Funded)', 'Generative AI Design for Civil 3D in Singapore — WSQ-funded, hands-on. What you learn, who it is for, and the real cost after 50-70% WSQ funding and SkillsFuture Credit.', 'generative ai civil 3d course, wsq generative design civil, ai infrastructure design course, civil 3d automation singapore, skillsfuture civil 3d ai', '2024-09-05 09:00:00', '2024-09-05 09:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @is_sg > 0 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `mmd_blog_post` WHERE `url_key` = 'generative-ai-design-for-civil-3d-course-singapore-guide');
