nclude the exam?</h3><p>Check the current course page before enrolling — exam voucher inclusion varies by intake and is stated there. Ask us directly if it is not clear; we would rather answer than have you assume.</p> <h3>What happens if I fail the exam?</h3><p>The ACP is a vendor exam sat under Autodesk''''s rules, including their retake policy. The class prepares you with timed practice under exam conditions, but the certification itself is awarded by Autodesk, not by us.</p> <h2>Next step</h2> <p>If this matches the work you do — or the work you want to move into — <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/wsq-autodesk-certified-professional-acp-for-revit-architectural-design.html">WSQ - Autodesk Certified Professional (ACP) for Revit Architectural Design</a> is the course page, with the current schedule and the funding breakdown. Claim up to 70% WSQ funding or use your SkillsFuture Credit.</p> <p><em>Course fees, funding tiers and software versions change. Figures here were correct at the time of writing — confirm the current position on the course page before enrolling.</em></p>', 'Tertiary Infotech Academy', 1, '2024-10-23', 'TGS-2023037587', 'TGS-2023037587', 'ACP Revit Architectural Design: Certification Prep Guide for Singapore (WSQ-Funded)', 'Autodesk Certified Professional (ACP) for Revit Architectural Design in Singapore — WSQ-funded, hands-on. What you learn, who it is for, and the real cost after 50-70% WSQ funding and SkillsFuture Credit.', 'acp revit architectural design, autodesk certified professional revit, revit certification singapore, wsq acp revit, revit exam prep course, skillsfuture revit certification', '2024-10-23 09:00:00', '2024-10-23 09:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @is_sg > 0 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `mmd_blog_post` WHERE `url_key` = 'autodesk-certified-professional-acp-revit-architecture-exam-prep-singapore-guide');
