ge before enrolling — exam voucher inclusion varies by intake and is stated there. Ask us directly if it is not clear; we would rather answer than have you assume.</p> <h3>What happens if I fail the exam?</h3><p>The ACP is a vendor exam sat under Autodesk''''s rules, including their retake policy. The class prepares you with timed practice under exam conditions, but the certification itself is awarded by Autodesk, not by us.</p> <h2>Next step</h2> <p>If this matches the work you do — or the work you want to move into — <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/wsq-autodesk-certified-professional-acp-for-revit-mechanical-design.html">WSQ - Autodesk Certified Professional (ACP) for Revit Mechanical Design</a> is the course page, with the current schedule and the funding breakdown. Claim up to 70% WSQ funding or use your SkillsFuture Credit.</p> <p><em>Course fees, funding tiers and software versions change. Figures here were correct at the time of writing — confirm the current position on the course page before enrolling.</em></p>', 'Tertiary Infotech Academy', 1, '2024-11-16', 'TGS-2023036661', 'TGS-2023036661', 'ACP Revit Mechanical (MEP) Design: Certification Prep Guide for Singapore (WSQ-Funded)', 'Autodesk Certified Professional (ACP) for Revit Mechanical Design in Singapore — WSQ-funded, hands-on. What you learn, who it is for, and the real cost after 50-70% WSQ funding and SkillsFuture Credit.', 'acp revit mechanical design, autodesk certified professional revit mep, revit mep certification singapore, wsq acp revit mechanical, mep bim course, skillsfuture revit mep', '2024-11-16 09:00:00', '2024-11-16 09:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @is_sg > 0 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `mmd_blog_post` WHERE `url_key` = 'autodesk-certified-professional-acp-revit-mechanical-exam-prep-singapore-guide');
